ms/v1/","context":{"app_id":4351380,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-4351380","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T08:40:56Z","value":2,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5173120","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4351380-1846651706693593","game_id":"steam-4351380","kind":"announcement","title":"Hair Removal Salon Simulator – Joins Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Hello, everyone!Let's get rid of all the guests' thick body hair completely! Hair Removal Salon Simulator is confirmed to be part of Steam Next Fest. Come and try the demo!Game Description:Ready your laser, rev up those trimmers, and run your own hair removal salon! Utilize cutting-edge salon tech, leaving clients hair-free and feeling fresh. Manage their pain levels, launch ludicrous sales pitches, and sink profits into gear upgrades and employees. Become a grooming powerhouse!If you encounter ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T03:50:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693593","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4351380-1846018067942769","game_id":"steam-4351380","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.9.3","summary":"Thank you for playing the Hair Removal Salon Simulator demo! We’ve released the following update today.■ ImprovementsTo avoid confusion with the Anti-Inflammatory Cream, the Cooling Gel has been changed to a Cooling Spray.Timed Mode, where customers have a waiting time, can now be selected in the demo as well.Thank you to everyone who sent in reports! If you find a bug, please let us know through the in-game bug report screen.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T03:13:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067942769","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4351380-1846018067937678","game_id":"steam-4351380","kind":"update","title":"体験版アップデート(v0.9.2) / Demo Update v0.9.2","summary":"Thank you for playing the Hair Removal Salon Simulator demo!We've released the following update today.■ Bug FixesFixed minor localization bugs.■ ImprovementsSome players were losing track of inflammation effects, so we've added on-screen icons that point to inflammation effects outside your view.The curtain no longer closes automatically when a customer gets into the bed while the player is standing near the curtain.Thank you to everyone who sent in reports!If you find a bug, please report it vi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T02:52:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067937678","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4351380-1845383656395291","game_id":"steam-4351380","kind":"update","title":"体験版アップデート(v0.9.1) / Demo Update v0.9.1","summary":"Thank you for playing the Hair Removal Salon Simulator demo!We've released the following update today.■ Bug Fixes・Fixed an issue where customers' hair turned into something like a scrub brush when graphics quality was set to Medium or lower・Fixed an issue where small icons stayed on screen in the Storage menu・Fixed an issue where the cleaning tutorial would not appear if you equipped the vacuum before the end of Day 1■ Improvements・Added a hint on how to use the cooling gel to the equipment sele","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T05:12:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656395291","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4351380-1845383656392465","game_id":"steam-4351380","kind":"announcement","title":"Hair Removal Salon Simulator Free Demo Now Available!","summary":"Hello, everyone! The free demo of the hilarious simulation game Hair Removal Salon Simulator is now available! The game has also been confirmed to participate in the Steam Next Fest this October. Come and give it a try!About the GameHair Removal Salon Simulator is a business simulation game where you run a salon exclusively for men.Use the latest medical-grade lasers to burn away every last bit of your customers' unwanted body hair. Push your laser skills to the limit by keeping customers right ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T03:12:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656392465","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4351380-1826362059933143","game_id":"steam-4351380","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest ends on March 17 at 23:59 (JST)! Thank you to our 226 particip","summary":"Dear players,Thank you so much to everyone participating in the current playtest! We initially expected around 50 participants, but we were absolutely blown away to receive requests from 226 of you. We are truly grateful! Seeing your passionate reviews and reports—like \"playing silently until morning\" or \"seeing body hair in my dreams\"—has been incredibly motivating for us as developers.We would like to announce the official end date and time for the playtest. The current playtest access will en","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-10T15:18:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826362059933143","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4351380-1825727806716656","game_id":"steam-4351380","kind":"announcement","title":"Burn Gentlemen's Hair in Hair Removal Salon Simulator! ~ 3/17","summary":"\\ Burn away gentlemen's unwanted hair and control their screams. Free Playtest Sign-ups Begin for the Unique Management Sim \"Hair Removal Salon Simulator\" ~ \"Beauty is pain.\" Aim to become the No.1 luxury salon with the latest lasers and aggressive upselling. ~Solo game developer Yoshio Games (Representative: Yoshio) is excited to announce that a free Closed Beta Test (Steam Playtest) for the PC (Steam) management simulation game \"Hair Removal Salon Simulator\" has officially begun today. In this","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-02T05:34:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825727806716656","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4351380":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:11:59Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:11:59Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4351380":"2026-10-26T02:11:59Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4351380":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:11:59Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:11:59Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5173120":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:11:59Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:11:59Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4351380","app_id":4351380,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:34Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","